SUMMARY:Thanksgiving (2023)
LOCATION:Moreland Theater\, 6712 SE Milwaukie Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.4752;-122.6504
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Eli Roth · 106 min\n\nAfter a Black Friday riot ends in t
 ragedy\, a mysterious Thanksgiving-inspired killer terrorizes Plymouth\, M
 assachusetts - the birthplace of the holiday. Picking off residents one by
  one\, what begins as random revenge killings are soon revealed to be part
  of a larger\, sinister holiday plan.\n\nTickets: https://morelandtheater.
 com/tickets/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screen
 s-pdx/
URL:https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/
END:VEVENT
